// Developer-specific build settings.
//
// Copy this file to `Local.xcconfig` (gitignored) and fill in your values.
// `make project` does that for you automatically if the file is missing.
//
// This exists because Dialect.xcodeproj is generated and gitignored: anything
// set through Xcode's signing UI is destroyed by the next `make project`.
// Settings that must survive regeneration, but must not be committed, live here.

// Your Apple Developer team identifier, needed only for builds that run on a
// physical device. Simulator builds do not need it. Find it in Xcode under
// Settings > Accounts, or at developer.apple.com under Membership.
//
// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = ABCDE12345
